    "description": "Tremendous opportunity to own a tastefully updated two-unit building in the highly desirable Inner-Sunset with a versatile layout and that will be delivered VACANT! Behind the timeless and contemporary facade are two flats that present the winning combination of traditional warmth and modern upgrades for a 21st century lifestyle.  Both flats open to gorgeous wood floors, spacious living/dining areas with fireplaces, updated kitchens with new appliances, all awash with plenty of natural light, and the ideal floor plan with the bedrooms positioned perfectly for privacy at the rear of the flats overlooking the serene backyard/garden.  There is an additional living space with separate access located on the first level with an updated bathroom, wet bar, new flooring and with direct access to the garden. There is a large two car garage with side-by-side parking with plenty of room for storage that add the finishing touches to this exceptional property that is close to shops, cafes, restaurants, playgrounds, public transportation, UCSF, Golden Gate Park, and more!"
  },
